message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived Zenodo release and the associated manuscript. Replace the placeholders below after the release is published."
title: "FIC Literature-Selection Simulation: Synthetic Citation Networks and Comparative Strategies"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Chiruka"
    given-names: "Matildah"
  - family-names: "Siakola"
    given-names: "Innocent"
abstract: >-
  Python code for an illustrative simulation comparing literature-selection
  strategies on synthetic citation networks and evaluating recovery of planted
  citation lineage. The simulation is exploratory and is not an empirical
  validation of the conceptual FIC framework.
keywords:
  - literature review
  - citation networks
  - synthetic simulation
  - reproducible research
